{"id":"fc53672eb2d1974a","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-re-no-inf.md","title":"c.e. 度并非格（书外结果待核实）","display":"thm-re-no-inf — c.e. 度并非格（书外结果待核实）","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-re-no-inf","aliases":["20-thm-re-no-inf"],"display":"thm-re-no-inf — c.e. 度并非格（书外结果待核实）","chapter":"supplement","section":"supplement.degree-structure","source_kind":"legacy-supplement","verification_status":"pending-source","source_reference":"既有 c.e. 非格结果的签名修复；书外证明待补","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"depends_on":["[[20-df-redeg]]","[[20-df-degle]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-re-no-inf"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-re-no-inf</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-re-no-inf — c.e. 度并非格（书外结果待核实）"},{"key":"chapter","html":"supplement"},{"key":"section","html":"supplement.degree-structure"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"legacy-supplement"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"pending-source"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"既有 c.e. 非格结果的签名修复；书外证明待补"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e888141c21b61ce5\" href=\"?note=e888141c21b61ce5\" title=\"20-df-degle\">20-df-degle</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>下界量词全在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\">\\(\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\le\">\\(\\le\\)</span> 为 c.e. 度的继承顺序。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f389bdba28de0478\" href=\"?note=f389bdba28de0478\" title=\"20-df-redeg\">20-df-redeg</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e888141c21b61ce5\" href=\"?note=e888141c21b61ce5\" title=\"20-df-degle\">20-df-degle</a>。</p>\n<aside class=\"callout\" data-kind=\"todo\"><div class=\"callout-title\">核验边界</div><p>本条状态为 pending-source；正文给出修订后的定义或命题草案，尚缺完整来源核对或独立证明。不可仅凭文件类型将其作为已认证定理使用。</p>\n</aside>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}re\\text{-}no\\text{-}inf}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n\\neg\\exists\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n[\\mathbf c\\le\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\land\n\\forall\\mathbf d\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n((\\mathbf d\\le\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b)\\Rightarrow\\mathbf d\\le\\mathbf c)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}re\\text{-}no\\text{-}inf}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n\\neg\\exists\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n[\\mathbf c\\le\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\land\n\\forall\\mathbf d\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n((\\mathbf d\\le\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b)\\Rightarrow\\mathbf d\\le\\mathbf c)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这是原文件实际表达的“某对 c.e. 度没有最大下界”，不是免疫集合没有无限 c.e. 子集。上半格不蕴含格；但全部度中没有下确界的例子，也不能直接限制成 c.e. 例子。已保留原意并展开 inf 的量词，c.e. 非格的独立来源和证明待补。</p>\n<p>来源：既有 c.e. 非格结果的签名修复；书外证明待补。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-redeg","status":"resolved","id":"f389bdba28de0478","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-redeg]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-degle","status":"resolved","id":"e888141c21b61ce5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-degle]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-redeg","status":"resolved","id":"f389bdba28de0478","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-redeg]]；see [[20-df-degle]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-degle","status":"resolved","id":"e888141c21b61ce5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-redeg]]；see [[20-df-degle]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\le","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}re\\text{-}no\\text{-}inf}\\vdash\n\\exists\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n\\neg\\exists\\mathbf c\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n[\\mathbf c\\le\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b\\land\n\\forall\\mathbf d\\in\\mathcal R_{\\mathrm{deg}}\\\n((\\mathbf d\\le\\mathbf a,\\mathbf b)\\Rightarrow\\mathbf d\\le\\mathbf c)].","display":true}],"bytes":1717,"backlinks":[{"id":"4011ec29b6dff303","anchor":"ref-15","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-re-no-inf]]"},{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-483","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-re-no-inf]] — 章 supplement；直接提供者 2 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-483","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-re-no-inf]]"}],"outgoing":["f389bdba28de0478","e888141c21b61ce5"]}